To strengthen governance and prevent recurrence, the following measures will be
 implemented:
 - An immediate re-briefing session will be conducted with the involved personnel to reinforce compliance standards and clarify the appropriate scope of authority;
 - Privacy awareness and data protection principles will be reinforced across the team;
 - Internal controls governing the use of operational documentation will be strengthened;
 - Passenger photographs will not be used for routine operational updates unless explicitly required by regulatory or security obligations.
